  "description": "Community Forum for Umbraco - an Umbraco-native discussion forum. Boards as content; threads, posts, reports and profiles in transactional tables. Server-rendered and SEO-ready, with a guided installer, a Community backoffice section, a built-in moderation rules engine and optional AI-assisted moderation via Umbraco.AI. Free to use.",
